# Keep SPEC.md in sync

Whenever you change behaviour, architecture, auth, APIs, data model, configuration,
deployment, or iOS/server UX in this repo, update [`SPEC.md`](SPEC.md) in the
**same change**.

- Treat `SPEC.md` as the source of truth for how the system works *as built*.
- Prefer editing the relevant section over appending a changelog.
- Remove obsolete claims (do not leave “formerly…” cruft unless it explains a
  deliberate design choice that still matters).
- If `README.md` duplicates the same operator-facing detail, update that too.
- Do not wait to be asked — updating the spec is part of finishing the task.
